{"uid":"cffd470481ec4806","name":"test_project_role_alone_is_not_enough_without_the_operator_scope","fullName":"tests.test_projects#test_project_role_alone_is_not_enough_without_the_operator_scope","historyId":"6eb9f0f96b7a368400c2aaef4fbec512","time":{"start":1789166098859,"stop":1789166098985,"duration":126},"description":"GitHub Copilot review (round 2, PR #294): `add_project_member` /\n    `update_project_member` / `remove_project_member` / `update_project` all\n    gained a `require_scopes(request, [SCOPE_OPERATOR])` call, closing a gap\n    where a real project-role holder with only the universal\n    `caliber.viewer` scope could still perform an action section 2.4 says\n    needs `caliber.operator`. That fix had route-level test coverage only\n    through the (admin-scoped, and therefore operator-implying) default\n    `@test` identity, which cannot regress-test the scope check at all. This\n    proves the negative case directly with real, non-admin project members.\n\n    `add_project_member` refuses `role=\"owner\"` at the API layer (`payload.role\n    not in PROJECT_ROLES - {ROLE_OWNER}` -> 400), so the owner-role member\n    used for the member-mutation routes is inserted directly via\n    `db_session`, not through the API.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>GitHub Copilot review (round 2, PR #294): <code>add_project_member</code> /<br />\n<code>update_project_member</code> / <code>remove_project_member</code> / <code>update_project</code> all<br />\ngained a <code>require_scopes(request, [SCOPE_OPERATOR])</code> call, closing a gap<br />\nwhere a real project-role holder with only the universal<br />\n<code>caliber.viewer</code> scope could still perform an action section 2.4 says<br />\nneeds <code>caliber.operator</code>. That fix had route-level test coverage only<br />\nthrough the (admin-scoped, and therefore operator-implying) default<br />\n<code>@test</code> identity, which cannot regress-test the scope check at all. This<br />\nproves the negative case directly with real, non-admin project members.</p>\n<pre><code>`add_project_member` refuses `role=&quot;owner&quot;` at the API layer (`payload.role\nnot in PROJECT_ROLES - {ROLE_OWNER}` -&gt; 400), so the owner-role member\nused for the member-mutation routes is inserted directly via\n`db_session`, not through the API.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"event_loop_policy","time":{"start":1789165382973,"stop":1789165382973,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"tmp_path_factory","time":{"start":1789165383001,"stop":1789165383001,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"monkeypatch","time":{"start":1789166097406,"stop":1789166097406,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_default_tests_to_trusted_header_auth","time":{"start":1789166097406,"stop":1789166097406,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_clear_prompt_info_cache","time":{"start":1789166097406,"stop":1789166097406,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"stepsCount":0,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"_dispose_create_app_engines","time":{"start":1789166097407,"stop":1789166097407,"duration":0},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"shouldDisp